<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 474.75/475.75.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar closes flat at 474.75/475.75.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed flat for the third consecutive session at 474.75/475.75 as the Central Bank intervened selling dollars into a busy market, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;We saw a lot of demand for dollars, but it was all covered as necessary by the Central Bank,&quot; said one broker who saw a similar pattern of trade for the coming week.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
